{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>For not forever will I contend.</b> With Israel." "<b>And not forever will I be wrathful.</b> For I created the spirits, and behold it is fitting that a spirit from before Me be enwrapped." "<b>And souls I made.</b> (For) the meaning is doubled." "And behold <b>יעטוף</b> is from the root of לעני כי יעטף (Psalm 102:1)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 57, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:59:59.796903049Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}